    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d420">

                <pb facs="0465" n="365" xml:id="pg365"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">823.032/44: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Peru</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Smith</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-03-29T14:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 29,
                                1920—2 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>41. Your 56, March 23, 11 a.m.</p>
                <p>What is present Peruvian law regarding those who have taken part in the
                    rebellion? Do you consider law adequate?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Colby</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
